anthra_OSE Revision History
---------------------------

2026-11-16: Version 1.0.0

- Port of anthra_1920_OSE 0.0.5 by Tomas Saxer to text2skin 2.0 (skin
  format 1.2) under the new name anthra_OSE.
- screenBase abs1920x1080: the skin scales itself to the size of the OSD.
  Images that were given only with their position get a fixed size, so they
  scale as well.
- The build options of Make.config are options of the skin, set at runtime
  in the setup menu of text2skin: channel logos and their path, separator
  logos and their path, main menu logos, main menu font, alignment of the
  group lines in menus, timer info in the main menu, EPG and recording
  images, signal display.
- The lists of the menu logos from anthra_conf are part of the skin file
  (including the entries for the menu of yaVDR), anthra_conf is removed.
- EPG images and recording images from a scraper plugin (tokens
  {PresentPoster} and {RecordingPoster}). With an image the title and the
  info line of a recording end before it.
- All windows true colour (bpp 32).
- The video size is shown for UHD as well (from the Debian package). The
  menu background without menu logos uses an image that exists, four names in
  the lists of the menu logos are corrected.
- Makefile: the skin file is put together from xml/*.xml, directories from
  vdr.pc, option titles and values in the translation template. Removed:
  Make.config, the generated skin file and its backup, the old RelaxNG
  schema, compiled translations, the patches folder.
- Translations in UTF-8, options translated into de, es, fi, fr, it, nl.


